","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109234.patch","merged_at":"2025-12-02T18:00:31Z"},"body":"Fixes [godotengine/godot-proposals#6266](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6266)\r\n\r\nAdded tool-tip to 2D, 3D, Script, AssetLib (Main Screen Editor Plugins) buttons that shows keyboard shortcut.\r\n* Open 2D Editor `(Ctrl + F1)`\r\n* Open 3D Editor `(Ctrl + F2)`\r\n* Open Script Editor `(Ctrl + F3)`\r\n* Open Game View `(Ctrl + F4)`\r\n* Open Asset Library `(Ctrl + F5)`\r\n\r\nVideo of the Change in action:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/713979da-5917-4c95-8485-c922645d2879\r\n\r\nNote: The easiest solution I figured was reordering the Shortcut Creation and directly getting its reference in `add_main_plugin`\r\nHopefully doesn't break any compatibility.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109234/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/go